                                                "example_id": "6ab28da0-0ee7-44f6-bed8-bbd29af82b3d",
                                                "sense_id": "4277fbbb-7cf0-3256-96fa-dcc86ef25422",
                                                "text": "With the setting sun sending long shadows loping ahead of them over the smooth hillocks of the downs, they came up with the lagoon; a contentful return home, with appetite brisked up by a ten-mile walk, and plenty of food to satisfy it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63433fe7-b29a-42cd-9f24-05e71f8c8ad2",
                                                "sense_id": "4277fbbb-7cf0-3256-96fa-dcc86ef25422",
                                                "text": "Just upstream of Dryburgh Abbey, a reproduction of a classical Greek temple stands at the top of a wooded hillock on the river’s north bank."
